abstract: >-
  A practical decision protocol that combines ontological-mathematical coherence
  with phenomenological evidence. Hypotheses are scored with P0·E·C·ρ, normalized
  across candidates, and acted upon at an operational threshold of P* ≥ 0.51
  (with a higher threshold under a state guardrail). Includes Maze Tax, continuity
  anchors, and a synchronicity rubric. Licensed CC BY-NC-SA 4.0.
